        <details key="documentation" value="Summary:&#xA;Checks whether a move is a valid Knight move with exact L-shape geometry.&#xA;Algorithm:&#xA;1. Compute absolute differences dx and dy between source and destination.&#xA;2. Return true if and only if:&#xA;   - (dx == 2 and dy == 1) or&#xA;   - (dx == 1 and dy == 2)&#xA;3. Otherwise return false.&#xA;Related Features:&#xA;- Move.source&#xA;- Move.destination&#xA;Related Classes: Game, Move, Place, Rule&#xA;Input:&#xA;- game: current game state.&#xA;- move: candidate move to validate.&#xA;Output:&#xA;- true if the move is an L-shaped Knight move.&#xA;- false otherwise.&#xA;Pre-condition:&#xA;- game and move are not null.&#xA;Post-condition:&#xA;- No state is changed."/>
